cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OICT in research or in a product evaluation, please cite it as below."
title: "OICT: Open Immersive Commerce Transaction Framework"
abstract: >-
  A transaction-integrity layer for real-world purchases made inside immersive
  applications (games, 3D worlds, AR/VR) and through AI shopping agents. OICT
  specifies multi-party authorization, binding between interaction state and
  orders, AI agent purchase controls and minor-protection rules, and ships a
  reference implementation and an executable conformance suite.
type: software
authors:
